{# Render the full research page body.
   Re-used by /research (EN) and /de/research (DE).
   The calling template sets the locale via `t` (already injected by
   src.11tydata.js) and so all data flows through `research.domains[*].title[locale]`
   etc.

   Inputs in scope:
     research.domains  — array of 8 domains, each pre-grouped into featured/reference/background
     research.phases   — phase-key → { en, de } label map
     research.stats    — totals
     locale            — "en" | "de"
     t                 — i18n table for the current locale
     pageUrls          — per-locale URL lookup
     site              — site config
#}

{% if locale == "en" %}
